\begin_layout Section
network = mesh
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The goal of the setup is to test the energy balance in space.
 To that end the demand and supply are scattered over different nodes.
 They are connected to each other through directional lines with small losses but sufficient capacity.
 The lines are directional to avoid circular flows and the lines have losses to avoid multiple possible solutions.
 One of the supply units is obviously cheaper such that it is very clear what the solution should be.
\end_layout

