\begin_layout Standard
The goal of the setup is to test a rolling horizon.
 To that end the investment = fixed setup is expanded with a second horizon.
 Each horizon uses the same formulation.
 In the first horizon,
 there is already a small investment in expensive units and the model needs to invest in cheaper units.
 The second window has a higher demand requiring additional investments but there is also a shift in commodity prices such that the more 
